=== H. FINRA 5290: no splitting orders or executions for the primary purpose of maximizing credits or rebates ===
5290: No member or associated person shall engage in conduct that has the intent or effect of
  splitting any order into multiple smaller orders for execution or any execution into
  multiple smaller executions for transaction reporting for the primary purpose of
  maximizing a monetary or in-kind amount to be received by the member or associated person
  as a result of the execution of such orders or the transaction reporting of such executions
For purposes of this Rule, "monetary or in-kind amount" shall be defined to include, but not be limited to,
  any credits, commissions, gratuities, payments for or rebates of fees,
  or any other payments of value to the member or associated person
  every TWAP / VWAP slice is banned? False
